B">B</ref>; þissa <ref type="lawCode" target="law:MsA">A</ref>); þyssa ænig <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 18; hwæðrum þissa: oððe .. oððe <hi rend="italic">der folgenden, nämlich</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 1,1; þisra <ref type="lawCode" target="law:H">H</ref> <pb n="222"/><hi rend="bold">Ba</hi>) þis <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:neutrum"><abbr>nt</abbr></ref>, <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:bezuglich"><abbr>bez.</abbr></ref> <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:auf"><abbr>auf</abbr></ref> folgendes <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:von"><abbr>von</abbr></ref> jedem Numerus <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:und"><abbr>u.</abbr></ref> Genus;</hi> þis syndon þa domas <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> Insc. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> Insc. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> Insc. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> Insc <ref type="lawCode" target="law:H">H</ref>. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:El">El</ref> 11. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> Insc [<hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:aber"><abbr>aber</abbr></ref> ‘Obiges’</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:El">El</ref> 49]; þis is seo gerædnis <ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> Pro; þis is þæt frið <ref type="lawCode" target="law:AGu">AGu</ref> Pro <hi rend="bold">Bb</hi>) þis, (= þæt, hit: <hi rend="italic">‘es’</hi>) <hi rend="italic">weisend <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:auf"><abbr>auf</abbr></ref> den folgenden, <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:mit"><abbr>mit</abbr></ref></hi> þæt (þe) <hi rend="italic">beginnenden abhängigen Satz;</hi> gif þæs geweorðe, þæt <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 5; þis ærest, þæt <hi rend="italic">nämlich</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> Pro 1; þes ne byð na gelic, þe hit bi